      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Idoling Around is a wacky physics-based platforming game In which you
    play as a lonesome Idol who was stolen by pesky explorers. You have one objective;
    roll your way back to your pedestal.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s no easy task, you will
    find yourself in treacherous jungles, Deep Caverns and Perilous temples. There
    are many platforming and unexpected traps found in the world of Idoling Around.
    You may find yourself falling in a pitfall, crushed by a manic boulder, or melted
    into molten by Lava.\r\n\r\nBut that\u2019s not to say that there isn\u2019t
    enjoyment and friends to be found along the way!"
